<DTA TYPE="STRING">NOTES:<BRK/>(1) Modify paragraph 3.6.4 Viscosity and Pot Life, of <RID>MIL-PRF-85285</RID> as follows: <BRK/><BRK/>The viscosity of the admixed coating, when tested in accordance with <RID>ASTM D1200</RID> through a No. 4 Ford cup, shall be as follows:</DTA>
